        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-002657",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Risk Factors–Risks Relating to the Industries in Which We Operate—The market value of our vessels, and those we may acquire in the future, may fluctuate significantly.”",
        "start_character": 20049,
        "end_character": 20217
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-002657",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-002657-3bc10f5a0b1392e0",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-002657",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also continually monitor developments in the Container and Tanker shipping industry and, subject to market demand, will adjust the number of vessels on charters and the charter periods for our vessels according to market conditions.",
        "start_character": 12813,
        "end_character": 13048
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-002657",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-002657-3bc10f5a0b1392e0",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-002657",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also intend to take advantage of the cyclical nature of the market by buying and selling ships when we believe favorable opportunities exist.",
        "start_character": 9016,
        "end_character": 9160
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-002657",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-002657-3bc10f5a0b1392e0",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-002657",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are responsible for the technical management of the vessel and for maintaining the vessel, periodic drydocking, cleaning and painting, and performing work required by regulations.",
        "start_character": 21648,
        "end_character": 21830
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-002657",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-002657-3bc10f5a0b1392e0",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-002657",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe this strategy provides the cash flow stability, and high utilization rates of the charter market, while at the same time enabling us to benefit from periods of increasing short-term or spot market rates.",
        "start_character": 11634,
        "end_character": 11848
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-002657",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-002657-3bc10f5a0b1392e0",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-002657",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have also developed a network of relationships with vessel brokers who help facilitate vessel charters and acquisitions.",
        "start_character": 13242,
        "end_character": 13365
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-002657",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-002657-3bc10f5a0b1392e0",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-002657",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We rely upon the safety management system that we and our technical management team have developed for compliance with the ISM Code.",
